ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261010/202610102323272581_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261010/202610102323272581_720.jpg"> </div><p>【比赛战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-11/match2067704date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">曼联1-1十人热刺 本坦库尔顶牛染红 姆伯莫破门索兰克92分钟绝平</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-11/6aca837b0288bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英超积分榜：曼联6轮积6分第12，热刺开季6轮不胜但摆脱垫底排倒3</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261011/zhanbao_image_2067704_1791656636_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261011/zhanbao_image_2067704_1791656636_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261011/zhanbao_image_2067704_1791656636_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>曼联1-1战平十人热刺，曼联遭遇4轮不胜，热刺遭遇6轮不胜。本场姆伯莫破门，索兰克绝平，本坦库尔染红。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-11/match2075481date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">皇马1-0黄潜 维尼修斯拉拽头发直红+进球被吹迪奥曼德处子球</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-11/6acaa7a54cda1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">西甲积分榜：皇萨竞齐取胜！巴萨5分优势领跑，皇马落后榜首6分</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261011/zhanbao_image_2075481_1791665453_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261011/zhanbao_image_2075481_1791665453_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261011/zhanbao_image_2075481_1791665453_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>皇马1-0比利亚雷亚尔。积分榜方面，皇马18分暂升第三，黄潜8分第十二。本场迪奥曼德首球，维尼修斯破门被吹并被直红罚下。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-11/match2075476date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">全胜领跑！巴萨3-0赫塔费各赛事9连胜 戈登首球热苏斯破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261011/zhanbao_image_2075476_1791656504_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261011/zhanbao_image_2075476_1791656504_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261011/zhanbao_image_2075476_1791656504_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>巴萨以3-0击败赫塔费。积分榜方面，巴萨积24分排在榜首，领先排在次席的马竞5分，赫塔费积8分排在第13位。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-10/match2067698date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">终结3轮不胜！切尔西5-1大胜伯恩茅斯 亨德森2射1传佩德罗双响</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.66" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261010/zhanbao_image_2067698_1791646923_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.66" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.66" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261010/zhanbao_image_2067698_1791646923_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261010/zhanbao_image_2067698_1791646923_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>切尔西5-1伯恩茅斯，终结英超三轮不胜；伯恩茅斯两连败，且英超前六轮一胜难求。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-11/match2057437date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">国米3-0帕尔马先赛3分领跑 恰20点射苏契奇图拉姆破门 斯彭斯首秀</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261011/zhanbao_image_2057437_1791654320_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261011/zhanbao_image_2057437_1791654320_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261011/zhanbao_image_2057437_1791654320_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>国际米兰3-0帕尔马。本场过后，国米5胜1平积16分暂升榜首，本场苏契奇、恰20以及图拉姆破门。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-10/match2076793date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">仍居第2！拜仁2-2奥格斯堡 凯恩助攻双响拜仁4球越位 诺伊尔送礼</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261010/zhanbao_image_2076793_1791645553_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261010/zhanbao_image_2076793_1791645553_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261010/zhanbao_image_2076793_1791645553_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>拜仁客场2-2战平奥格斯堡，拜仁积11分仍居第2名，距榜首多特2分。本场诺伊尔送礼，赛巴里、布朗破门。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-11/match2075473date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">4连胜！马竞2-1绝杀十人阿拉维斯 小蜘蛛造红牌罗梅罗88分钟绝杀</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261011/zhanbao_image_2075473_1791648569_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261011/zhanbao_image_2075473_1791648569_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261011/zhanbao_image_2075473_1791648569_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>马竞2-1击败十人阿拉维斯，取得西甲四连胜！本场格里马尔多、罗梅罗破门。</p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-10/6aca59579aee0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">葡足协主席：足协、主帅都希望C罗尽快归队，重要的是他想回归</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.46" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abd918bd0c95.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.46" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.46" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abd918bd0c95.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abd918bd0c95.jpg"> </div><p>葡萄牙足协主席佩德罗·普罗恩萨今天接受媒体采访，表示葡萄牙足协、国家队主帅全体都希望C罗重返国家队。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-11/6aca64b63a92cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">情况不妙！BBC：因卡皮耶赛后恢复时脚踝受伤，被工作人员抬离</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251224/694ad285a340d.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251224/694ad285a340d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251224/694ad285a340d.jpg"> </div><p>BBC消息，阿森纳球员因卡皮耶在赛后进行恢复训练受伤，情况令人担忧。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-11/6acaa02a0c7d9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">这是什么剧情？维尼修斯拉拽对手头发犯规，被直红罚下且进球取消</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261011/202610110435522013.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261011/202610110435522013.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261011/202610110435522013.jpg"> </div><p>皇马vs比利亚雷亚尔。第72分钟，维尼修斯进球后VAR介入，主裁回看发现他拉拽对手头发犯规，取消进球并将其直红罚下。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-11/6acaa7693287dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿斯：维尼修斯拉拽对手头发预计至少停赛2场，几乎无缘国家德比</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261011/202610110435522013.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261011/202610110435522013.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261011/202610110435522013.jpg"> </div><p>西甲第8轮，皇马对阵比利亚雷亚尔，维尼修斯因拉拽对手头发被红牌罚下。据《阿斯报》报道，维尼修斯可能因此缺战对巴萨的比赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-11/6acab72f6f584native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">裁判报告：维尼修斯拉拽对手头发 大声抗议 攻击性姿态靠近裁判</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261011/202610110435522013.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261011/202610110435522013.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261011/202610110435522013.jpg"> </div><p>皇马1-0比利亚雷亚尔，维尼修斯